{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34033","headline":"送羊振文先辈往桂阳归觐 · 皮日休","name":"送羊振文先辈往桂阳归觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂阳新命下彤墀，彩服行当欲雪时。\n登第已闻传祢赋，问安犹听讲韩诗。\n竹人临水迎符节，风母穿云避信旗。\n无限湘中悼骚恨，凭君此去谢江蓠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}